    "settings.hotCornerConflictBody" : {"extractionState":"manual","localizations":{"en":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CornerPet can’t detect whether macOS Hot Corners conflict with this setting. If the same corner has a system action, both may respond. Go to System Settings → Desktop & Dock → Hot Corners… to clear that action, or choose another CornerPet corner. CornerPet never reads or changes these system settings."}},"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"CornerPet 无法检测 macOS 触发角是否冲突。若同一角落已分配系统操作，两者可能同时响应。请前往“系统设置 → 桌面与程序坞 → 触发角…”，清除该角落的系统操作，或在 CornerPet 中选择其他角落。CornerPet 不会读取或更改这些系统设置。"}}}},
